                <pb facs="0425" n="337" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg337"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic">August 9,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay requests Mr. Choate to obtain, if possible, a copy of the
                    representations to the Russian Government by the British Government on the
                    subject of contraband of war, as indicated by press reports, and forward it to
                    the Department.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
